types=[('crate','Kontejner','Container','M4 7h16v13H4zM3 4h18v4H3zM9 11h6'),('weapon','Zbraňová bedna','Weapon crate','M3 5h18v15H3zM6 14l3-4h9m-5 0v4m-6 0h4'),('extraction','Extrakce','Extraction','M5 4h8v5M5 4v16h8v-5M10 12h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4'),('hatch','Raider Hatch','Raider Hatch','M4 5h16v15H4zM8 5v15m8-15v15M8 10h8m-8 5h8'),('key','Zamčené dveře','Locked door','M14 4h6v16h-6M9 7a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8ZM9 15v6m0-3h3'),('quest','Cíl úkolu','Quest objective','m12 3 9 9-9 9-9-9zM12 7v6m0 3v1'),('arc','Nebezpečí ARC','ARC danger','m12 3 10 18H2zM8 16l4-8 4 8m-6-3h4'),('pvp','PvP hotspot','PvP hotspot','M4 4l16 16M20 4 4 20M3 7V3h4m10 0h4v4M3 17v4h4m10 0h4v-4'),('room','Loot místnost','Loot room','M4 4h16v16H4zM8 20V9h8v11M12 13v3'),('note','Poznámka','Note','M5 3h14v14l-4 4H5zM9 8h6m-6 4h6m0 9v-5h4'),('player','Moje značka','Player marker','m12 3 8 17-8-4-8 4z')]
def svg(path,size=24):return f'<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="{size}" height="{size}" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="{path}"/></svg>'
for id,cs,en,p in types:put('assets/icons/'+id+'.svg',svg(p))
for name,g,d,l,p in areas:put('assets/glyphs/'+name.lower().replace(' ','-')+'.svg',svg(p))
symbols=''.join(f'<symbol id="{id}" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="{p}"/></symbol>' for id,cs,en,p in types)
symbols+=''.join(f'<symbol id="area-{name.lower().replace(" ","-")}" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="{p}"/></symbol>' for name,g,d,l,p in areas)
put('assets/sprite.svg',f'<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs>{symbols}</defs></svg>')
tokens=':root{--map-paper:#171D20;--map-ink:#F2EEE7;--map-secondary:#C8C7C2;--map-muted:#A2A8AA;--map-accent:#F4AD82;--map-line:#849095;--map-grid:#D5DDD51C;--map-halo:#F2EEE7;--map-chip:#171D20;--map-chip-ink:#F2EEE7;--map-filter:saturate(.38) sepia(.22) hue-rotate(345deg) brightness(.72) contrast(.92);\n'
tokens+=''.join(f'--loot-{n.lower().replace(" ","-")}:{d};\n' for n,g,d,l,p in areas)+'}\n'
tokens+='[data-theme="light"]{--map-paper:#F2EEE7;--map-ink:#242A2E;--map-secondary:#424C51;--map-muted:#515C62;--map-accent:#8B451C;--map-line:#66747C;--map-grid:#29323426;\n'+''.join(f'--loot-{n.lower().replace(" ","-")}:{l};\n' for n,g,d,l,p in areas)+'}\n/* Map pins always retain an opaque dark capsule. Theme colors are for legends, not raw screenshot pixels. */\n.map-pin{'+''.join(f'--loot-{n.lower().replace(" ","-")}:{d};' for n,g,d,l,p in areas)+'}\n'
put('tokens.css',tokens)
# Fictional procedural terrain: no external map inputs, place names or real geography.
random.seed(47)
terrain='<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1200" height="900" viewBox="0 0 1200 900"><rect width="1200" height="900" fill="#727B68"/><path d="M0 590Q180 440 330 600T650 650T950 540T1200 580V900H0Z" fill="#555F56"/>'
for cx,cy in [(210,210),(990,180),(880,780)]:
 for rad in range(55,390,27):
  pts=[]
  for i in range(73):
   a=i/72*math.tau;r=rad*(1+.09*math.sin(a*3)+.06*math.cos(a*5));pts.append(f'{cx+math.cos(a)*r:.1f},{cy+math.sin(a)*r*.64:.1f}')
  terrain+=f'<polyline points="{" ".join(pts)}" fill="none" stroke="#A0A18A" stroke-opacity=".38" stroke-width="1.4"/>'
terrain+='<path d="M-50 670C170 440 280 790 450 600S640 290 840 370 1070 240 1240 170" fill="none" stroke="#4A737B" stroke-width="108"/><path d="M-50 670C170 440 280 790 450 600S640 290 840 370 1070 240 1240 170" fill="none" stroke="#7C9B9D" stroke-width="2"/>'
road='M-20 310 220 340 360 180 590 190 720 480 1060 600 1220 500M270 920 360 640 720 480 840 40'
terrain+=f'<path d="{road}" fill="none" stroke="#343D3E" stroke-width="26"/><path d="{road}" fill="none" stroke="#B5AF96" stroke-width="17"/><path d="{road}" fill="none" stroke="#807E6C" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="14 9"/>'
for x,y in [(200,370),(420,220),(810,510),(930,570),(280,700)]:
 terrain+=f'<path d="M{x-22} {y-22}h160v130h-160z" fill="#999580" opacity=".5"/>'
 for j in range(6):
  xx=x+j%3*43;yy=y+j//3*51
  terrain+=f'<rect x="{xx}" y="{yy}" width="{random.randint(22,35)}" height="{random.randint(25,40)}" fill="#C5BEA6" stroke="#4A5050" stroke-width="3"/>'
terrain+='<g fill="#D7CDB0" opacity=".5">'+''.join(f'<rect x="{random.randrange(1200)}" y="{random.randrange(900)}" width="3" height="3"/>' for _ in range(130))+'</g></svg>'
put('assets/fictional-terrain.svg',terrain)
# Every UI string is registered here; README and labels.json share the same source.
labels={}
def t(cs,en):labels[cs]=en;return cs
def ic(id):return f'<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#{id}"/></svg>'
def b(cs,en,attrs='',cls=''):return f'<button class="{cls}" {attrs}>{t(cs,en)}</button>'
def badge(n):
 slug=n.lower().replace(' ','-');return f'<span class="badge" style="color:var(--loot-{slug})">{ic("area-"+slug)}{n}</span>'
def head(k,title,sub):return f'<div class="eyebrow">{k}</div><h1>{title}</h1><p>{sub}</p>'
names=[('dam','Dam Battlegrounds'),('buried','Buried City'),('spaceport','Spaceport'),('bluegate','The Blue Gate'),('riven','Riven Tides'),('stella','Stella Montis'),('pendola','Pendola Pass')]
points=[('crate','Electrical',34,30,'01',True),('room','Technological',71,62,'02',True),('quest','Mechanical',48,52,'03',True),('extraction','Raider',24,79,'04',False),('arc','ARC',81,27,'05',False),('hatch','Raider',56,84,'06',False),('note','Old World',17,48,'07',False),('weapon','Security',85,80,'08',False)]
def canvas(mini=False):
 pins=''
 for id,area,x,y,num,hi in points:
  pins+=f'<button class="map-pin {"highlight" if hi else "dimmed"} {"selected" if num=="01" else ""}" style="left:{x}%;top:{y}%;color:var(--loot-{area.lower().replace(" ","-")})" data-kind="{id}" data-area="{area}" aria-label="{dict((a,b) for a,b,c,d in types)[id]} {num}, {area}" data-number="{num}">{ic(id)}<small>{num} · {dict((n,g) for n,g,d,l,p in areas)[area]}</small></button>'
 return f'<div class="canvas {"mini" if mini else ""}" id="{"miniMap" if mini else "mapCanvas"}"><div class="terrain-wrap"><img class="terrain harmonised" src="assets/fictional-terrain.svg" alt="{t("Smyšlený terén — návrhová ukázka","Fictional terrain — design sample")}"><div class="grid"></div>{pins}</div><div class="map-corner">{t("SMYŠLENÝ TERÉN / UKÁZKA","FICTIONAL TERRAIN / SAMPLE")}</div>{"" if mini else '<div class="axis">A　　　 B　　　 C　　　 D　　　 E</div><div class="zoom">'+b('+','Zoom in','id="zoomIn" aria-label="Přiblížit"')+b('−','Zoom out','id="zoomOut" aria-label="Oddálit"')+b('100 %','100%','id="resetZoom" aria-label="Obnovit zobrazení"')+'</div><div class="pan-hint">'+t('Klik: bod · tažení: posun','Click: point · drag: pan')+'</div>'}</div>'
